{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-tit-2-1","title":"Titus 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Directions given unto Titus both for his doctrine and life. 10 Of the duty of servants, and in general of all Christians.</p>\n<p>11-14; 1:9; 3:8; 1Ti 1:10; 6:3; 2Ti 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-2-2","title":"Titus 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the. Le 19:32; Job 12:12; Ps 92:14; Pr 16:31; Isa 65:20 sober. or, vigilant. 1Co 15:34; 1Th 5:6,8; 1Ti 3:2,11; 1Pe 1:13; 4:7; 5:8; *Gr: grave. 7; 1Ti 3:4,8,11; Php 4:8; *Gr: temperate. 1:8; Ac 24:25; 1Co 9:25; Ga 5:23; 2Pe 1:6; Mr 5:15; Lu 8:35; Ro 12:3 2Co 5:13; 1Pe 4:7; *Gr: sound. 1:13 in patience. 1Ti 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-2-3","title":"Titus 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>as. Ro 16:2; Eph 5:3; 1Ti 2:9,10; 3:11; 5:5-10; 1Pe 3:3-5 holiness. or holy women. false accusers. or, makebates. 1Ti 3:8,11 not given. 1:7 teachers. 4; Heb 5:12; Re 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-2-4","title":"Titus 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the. 1Ti 5:2,11,14 sober. or, wise. 2 to love their husbands. 1Ti 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-2-5","title":"Titus 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>discreet. 2 keepers. Ge 16:8,9; 18:9; Pr 7:11; 31:10-31; 1Ti 5:13 good. Ac 9:36,39; 1Ti 5:10 obedient. Ge 3:16; 1Co 11:3; 14:34; Eph 5:22-24,33; Col 3:18; 1Ti 2:11,12 1Pe 3:1-5 that. 2Sa 12:14; Ps 74:10; Ro 2:24; 1Ti 5:14; 6:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-2-6","title":"Titus 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"cha